      "writtenOn": "2022-09-07T12:48:46Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "As another comment, I expect the users of Ikev2VpnProfile do not get the userIdentity from IkeTunnelConnectionParams instead of calling getUserIdentity() to get the value. What is returned in getUserIdentity does no impact on the actual behavior or tests. I think it\u0027s kind of expected?\n\nThe API tries to get the value from IkeTunnelConnectionParams since it\u0027s defined as NonNull. Otherwise, I will consider that it should be null if IkeTunnelConnectionParams is set. Or may be it should return empty string if IkeTunnelConnectionParams is available.",
      "parentUuid": "b8880950_5e52298d",
      "revId": "36da3e4e15f68b87943f209d8d9c9a5a7e9efb34",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
